# Day 13 – AST-Based Code Migration Engine

## Objective

The objective of Day 13 was to build the core source code migration engine using the TypeScript Compiler API. This enables automatic analysis and transformation of Angular application source code.

---

# Features Implemented

## 1. AST Parser

Implemented a reusable parser service using the TypeScript Compiler API.

Responsibilities

- Parse TypeScript files
- Build AST
- Save transformed files

Files

```
src/parser/
```

---

## 2. Code Migration Service

Implemented a migration engine that scans the project and performs code transformations.

Responsibilities

- Scan *.ts files
- Parse source code
- Execute transformers
- Save updated files

Files

```
src/code-migration/
```

---

## 3. Component Transformer

Added support for Angular Component migration.

Responsibilities

- Locate Component decorators
- Prepare component metadata for migration

---

## 4. Module Transformer

Added NgModule transformation support.

Responsibilities

- Locate NgModules
- Prepare for Standalone migration

---

## 5. Provider Transformer

Implemented provider migration.

Responsibilities

- Detect providers
- Prepare provider migration

---

## 6. Project Scanning

Implemented project-wide scanning.

Scans

- Components
- Modules
- Services

Generates migration statistics.

---

## 7. Migration Report

Implemented automatic report generation.

Generated file

```
migration-report.json
```

Example

```json
{
  "projectName": "angular-8-example-app",
  "filesScanned": 126,
  "filesMigrated": 41,
  "components": 34,
  "modules": 11,
  "services": 18,
  "generatedAt": "2026-07-05T12:30:00Z"
}
```

